Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.69,0:00:05.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)一飞冲天！ 我！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.16,0:00:11.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好痛～！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.50,0:00:12.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(真月)游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.44,0:00:15.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个给你。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.66,0:00:18.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎!? 这是我的!?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.84,0:00:21.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊。你的活跃表现本部给予了肯定哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.98,0:00:22.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太棒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.89,0:00:24.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}声音太大了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.74,0:00:27.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们的事不是说了要保密吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.07,0:00:29.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦 抱歉。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.91,0:00:32.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}话说你和 Dr.菲卡的儿子
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.32,0:00:33.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}海斗是认识的对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.43,0:00:35.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊 那又怎样？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.16,0:00:37.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)危险！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.30,0:00:49.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(轨道7)真是的 海斗大人也真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.60,0:00:50.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}开口闭口就……。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.76,0:00:51.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((海斗:巴利安的调查
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.92,0:00:52.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进行得怎么样了！))
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.10,0:00:55.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且……恐怕巴里安已经
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.04,0:00:57.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不在哈特兰德了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.11,0:01:01.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哦！怎、怎么回事！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.54,0:01:02.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张纸是。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.55,0:01:14.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可、可恶，你这废纸！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.14,0:01:15.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.80,0:01:19.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是我心中不可或缺的存在。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.87,0:01:24.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是生存所需的食物，是滋润大地的恩泽之雨。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.29,0:01:26.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就是你。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.52,0:01:31.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我爱上了你。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.65,0:01:38.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咦？刚才好像有股毛骨悚然的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.00,0:01:39.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}静电窜过全身？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.70,0:01:45.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔……唔唔！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.12,0:01:47.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底是怎么回事！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.29,0:01:50.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一个个的全都黏黏糊糊 黏黏糊糊！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.91,0:01:55.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}俺可是要完成凯特大人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.49,0:01:56.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下达的命令{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.52,0:01:57.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}忙得很呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.21,0:02:00.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}笨蛋笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.87,0:02:09.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊～好痛好痛……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.39,0:02:13.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔～ 你这家伙！好痛啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.33,0:02:15.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这个笨蛋！哪里看……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.70,0:02:23.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.60,0:02:29.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊……啊啊～。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.50,0:02:33.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那、那个……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.27,0:02:38.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼！笨蛋{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说的人才是笨蛋～！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.77,0:02:46.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呕呃！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.41,0:02:39.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊、啊啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.04,0:04:37.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不行不行。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.32,0:04:46.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是怎么回事！？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.22,0:04:50.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这个IC电路里产生的噪声是。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.46,0:04:53.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无法解析 无法解析 无法解析。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.76,0:04:58.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((你是我心中不可或缺的存在))
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.08,0:05:02.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(KAITO)轨道 轨道！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.65,0:05:03.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巴里安的资料呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.08,0:05:04.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}欧比塔尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.36,0:05:06.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}欧比塔尔7！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.27,0:05:09.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是 是的！凯特大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.86,0:05:11.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巴里安的调查资料呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.66,0:05:13.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是 是的… 那个{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.48,0:05:15.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是我心中不可或缺的…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.73,0:05:16.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 不…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.49,0:05:19.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙 在迷糊什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.40,0:05:20.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}遵 遵命！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.68,0:05:32.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无法集中注意力～！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.09,0:05:48.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是我心中不可或缺的存在。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.89,0:05:50.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}恩泽之雨 那就是你。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.03,0:05:54.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我爱上了你。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.40,0:06:01.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}恋爱！俺预测已坠入爱河～。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.96,0:06:05.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那位大人的名字是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.61,0:06:08.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回忆？回忆？回忆？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.82,0:06:09.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不不 不是！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.83,0:06:11.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能是那么土气的名字……。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.21,0:06:14.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 比如说 艾德里安之类的。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.67,0:06:16.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊～ 好想见到我心爱的艾德里安啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.35,0:06:17.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想见他想得不得了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.01,0:06:28.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去买东西 然后回来啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.78,0:06:30.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊… 那位大人。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.78,0:06:35.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}请稍等一下…。嗯？ 这是 那位大人的东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.76,0:06:38.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}「救 救 我」。 什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.88,0:06:40.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这到底是怎么回事呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.03,0:06:49.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这 这里是！ 那个笨蛋的家。不会吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.74,0:06:54.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((喂 把果汁拿来。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.83,0:06:57.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好 好的 游马大人 马上就来。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.09,0:07:03.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}笨蛋 说果汁当然是番茄汁啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.41,0:07:05.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.77,0:07:08.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}饭太难吃了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.20,0:07:13.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所谓的救命原来是这么回事啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.36,0:07:18.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶 九十九游马不可原谅。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.43,0:07:23.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我回来了 我回来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.25,0:07:23.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(明里)欢迎回来。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.15,0:07:25.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(春)辛苦你了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.23,0:07:28.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我把 救 命 买回来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.63,0:07:31.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呃～ 鸡蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.49,0:07:33.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}醋。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.99,0:07:36.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}番茄酱
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.71,0:07:39.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有天妇罗粉。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.66,0:07:42.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谢谢。 辛苦你了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.54,0:07:45.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的 小欧波美帮大忙了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.01,0:07:47.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}跟某处的笨蛋不一样。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.22,0:07:50.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊～ 肚子好饿啊。 饭还没好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.21,0:07:53.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就赶紧开饭吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.90,0:07:55.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}笨蛋也来帮忙。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.69,0:07:58.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马那家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.20,0:08:01.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么个笨蛋又蠢又笨手笨脚的家伙{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.62,0:08:03.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是决斗的话 一下子就能搞定
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.92,0:08:05.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但那家伙有 星光体这个{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.65,0:08:06.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有个来历不明的生命体
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.99,0:08:07.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}附在你身上了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.07,0:08:11.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要加倍小心才是。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.49,0:08:18.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞，决斗的时间到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.40,0:08:19.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好，我奉陪。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.73,0:08:20.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.09,0:08:24.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奥比塔尔？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.64,0:08:27.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.69,0:08:29.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是来把这个交给你的。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.35,0:08:32.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！这是……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.72,0:08:35.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好吃的点心？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.78,0:08:40.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不对！是读作“挑战书”！你这个蠢货！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.30,0:08:42.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.05,0:08:44.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要向你发起决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.67,0:08:47.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果我赢了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.64,0:08:49.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就把你的欧波特解放出来。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.78,0:08:51.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？你是说欧波米吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.79,0:08:54.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}欧……原来叫欧波米啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.84,0:08:57.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多么可爱的名字啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.62,0:09:00.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把、把那位奥波米小姐放了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.38,0:09:01.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}听明白了吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.50,0:09:03.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不，我完全没搞懂啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.16,0:09:06.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎～呀，管你懂不懂{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.35,0:09:08.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就拿俺和奥波米小姐来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.23,0:09:09.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用决斗一决胜负。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.52,0:09:18.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂～。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.72,0:09:21.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}轨道，让你久等了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.30,0:09:23.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}哦哦，ｵ、奥波米小姐。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.96,0:09:28.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在，就由我把您从那里救出来。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.38,0:09:33.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}顿马！今天就是你的末日。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.51,0:09:34.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，一决胜负。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.54,0:09:36.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有意思。我奉陪到底。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.80,0:09:40.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（星光体）游马
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.58,0:09:43.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来决斗要开始了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.49,0:09:46.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.30,0:09:47.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.23,0:09:52.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（２人）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.85,0:09:56.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗盘 设置！ D视镜 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.11,0:10:00.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[扬声器]AR影像 链接完成。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.95,0:10:01.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(2人)决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.57,0:10:04.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先攻是俺嘞。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.94,0:10:07.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}俺的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.13,0:10:11.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}俺发动场地魔法 机器乐园！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.31,0:10:17.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里就是 俺们
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.13,0:10:19.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战斗的场地！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.45,0:10:21.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 俺
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.43,0:10:24.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤超级防御机器人 莱奥！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.07,0:10:34.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再发动 场地魔法机器乐园的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.95,0:10:35.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根据这个效果
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.97,0:10:38.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤了机械族怪兽的玩家{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.88,0:10:40.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1回合1次 从手牌{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.20,0:10:43.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将冠有超级防御机器人之名的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.98,0:10:44.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.40,0:10:46.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出来吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.67,0:10:47.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(大象)啪哦～嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.07,0:10:50.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超级防御机器人 大象！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.25,0:10:55.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哦！机器人好帅！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.81,0:10:58.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级8的怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.89,0:11:00.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马现在可不是佩服的时候啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.64,0:11:04.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}男孩子真是喜欢机器人呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.40,0:11:05.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那当然了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.97,0:11:08.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}机器人可是能让男人的心热血沸腾啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.25,0:11:11.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吃惊还太早了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.93,0:11:13.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超级防御机器人 雷欧在{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.86,0:11:16.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有其他冠以超级防御机器人之名的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.54,0:11:18.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽在场时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.77,0:11:21.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级可以变成2倍。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.23,0:11:25.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级8的怪兽2只
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.86,0:11:27.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然在第1回合就凑齐了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.09,0:11:29.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要来了 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.27,0:11:30.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是 是吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.80,0:11:33.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咱把等级8的机器雷欧和
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.06,0:11:34.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将机器大象和
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.00,0:11:38.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用两只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.18,0:11:40.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建超量网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.43,0:11:41.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.12,0:11:48.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闪耀的银河啊化作恋之光 寄宿于我身！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.73,0:11:52.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河的化身 在此降临。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.58,0:11:55.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧银河眼光子龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.32,0:11:57.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力3000！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.48,0:12:02.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 下跪的准备已经做好了么！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.74,0:12:18.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼 惊讶得说不出话了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.10,0:12:21.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不… 什么啊 那个发髻。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.60,0:12:24.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}失 失礼！ 不要以貌取人。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.35,0:12:26.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那 那么 我在此回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.14,0:12:28.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好 那我就上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.81,0:12:30.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.47,0:12:34.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 阿察察阿察！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.14,0:12:41.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿察察阿察是召唤成功时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.68,0:12:42.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给对手玩家
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.74,0:12:44.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}造成500点伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.51,0:12:52.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 我还要{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.40,0:12:53.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对手场上的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.56,0:12:55.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽超量素材的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.97,0:12:58.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下降300点{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.16,0:13:00.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来特殊召唤「噗噗噗」！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.52,0:13:02.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什 什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.98,0:13:05.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将等级3的「阿恰恰阿恰」和
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.37,0:13:07.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}「噗噗噗」进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.29,0:13:09.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.35,0:13:11.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建超量网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.08,0:13:13.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.50,0:13:18.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刻下节奏吧！弦魔人 噗噗噗节奏！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.88,0:13:27.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼！就凭那种攻击力能做什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.09,0:13:29.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没完！「噗噗噗节奏」在
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.82,0:13:31.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与怪兽超量怪兽战斗时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.12,0:13:33.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}消耗1个超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.89,0:13:38.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这场战斗中可以让攻击力翻倍。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.20,0:13:42.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 摩丝摩丝蜥蜴！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.32,0:13:44.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击玻璃人偶！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.74,0:13:46.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}蜥蜴混音弦！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.29,0:13:50.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什、什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.47,0:13:56.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.24,0:13:58.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就在这里 回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.05,0:14:02.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后摩丝摩丝蜥蜴的攻击力恢复原状！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.73,0:14:08.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然跟外表一样就是个笨蛋啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.69,0:14:10.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有点 可怜。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.00,0:14:17.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(欧比塔尔７)奥波米大人请您看着吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.73,0:14:19.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一定会打倒那个蜻蜓
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.60,0:14:21.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将您救出来的。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.46,0:14:24.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}俺的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.01,0:14:28.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}俺发动魔法卡 废品回收！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.24,0:14:30.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从自己的墓地里 将２只
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.76,0:14:32.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过除外机械族怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.75,0:14:35.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从墓地特殊召唤1只
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.05,0:14:36.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}机械族怪兽的超量怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.36,0:14:37.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.37,0:14:41.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复活吧！银河眼极光龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.50,0:14:54.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 本大爷还要
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.53,0:14:56.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤超级防御机器人 猴子！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.84,0:14:59.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当机械族怪兽被召唤时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.25,0:15:03.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场地魔法机器乐园的效果再次发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.37,0:15:07.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将超级防御机器人 猴子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.20,0:15:09.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再特殊召唤1只！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.95,0:15:14.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超级防御机器人 猴子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.12,0:15:15.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过那个效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.40,0:15:18.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以成为银河眼的超量素材。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.29,0:15:19.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.75,0:15:21.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接下来才是真正的胜负。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.10,0:15:23.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.26,0:15:25.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽 从墓地
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.60,0:15:26.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被特殊召唤的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.23,0:15:29.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用1个超量素材
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.15,0:15:31.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让攻击力提升1000点。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.19,0:15:34.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}俺用2个
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.38,0:15:36.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}提升2000点。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.66,0:15:44.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力5000！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.79,0:15:45.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不妙啊游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.31,0:15:47.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.34,0:15:49.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击嗡嗡作响的节奏。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.56,0:15:54.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}憧憬的银河眼全爆流！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.21,0:16:06.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈哈！知道厉害了吧托马！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.38,0:16:08.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼正如其名{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.57,0:16:10.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被打倒 被击碎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.36,0:16:12.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从那里重生的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.32,0:16:15.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才会发挥真正的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.04,0:16:18.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}俺就这样 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.50,0:16:22.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被破坏一次也在计算之中吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.88,0:16:25.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.06,0:16:29.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤起重机起重机！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.39,0:16:34.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动「起重机起重机」的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.00,0:16:37.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从自己的墓地里
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.86,0:16:39.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤1只等级3的怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.63,0:16:43.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我特殊召唤「阿恰恰弓箭手」！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.71,0:16:48.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}「阿恰恰弓箭手」在特殊召唤时
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.04,0:16:50.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给对手造成500点伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.27,0:16:57.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是我要把这个效果无效化{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.12,0:17:00.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤「阿恰恰拳击手」！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.61,0:17:04.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过这个效果
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.36,0:17:06.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤「阿恰恰拳击手」时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.13,0:17:09.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给对手造成400点伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.40,0:17:13.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}区区400点伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.33,0:17:14.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根本不算什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.54,0:17:16.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 干得漂亮！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.52,0:17:18.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(奥波米)游马 菜死了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.86,0:17:22.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈 奥波米小姐！？ 您… 您在
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.68,0:17:24.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为我加油对吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.88,0:17:27.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一定不会辜负这份心意。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.42,0:17:28.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(奥波米)快点赢啊 笨蛋。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.27,0:17:31.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 自己场上有
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.68,0:17:33.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级3的怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.82,0:17:36.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我可以从手牌特殊召唤这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.26,0:17:39.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出来吧 咪咪咪！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.38,0:17:43.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将 等级3的唰唰唰和
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.48,0:17:45.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唰唰唰蹦跳者 叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.76,0:17:47.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.94,0:17:49.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.35,0:17:51.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.65,0:17:56.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}敲响吧 太鼓魔人 咚咚咚咚鼓！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.52,0:18:02.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后同样 将等级3的咪咪咪和
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.14,0:18:04.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呱呱呱 叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.02,0:18:06.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.12,0:18:08.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.66,0:18:09.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.99,0:18:14.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奏响吧 旋律！ 管魔人 美乐美乐美乐迪！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.58,0:18:16.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后我还要
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.28,0:18:18.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动魔法卡 复活进行曲！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.94,0:18:21.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡 在自己场上
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.66,0:18:23.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当场上存在魔人怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.73,0:18:25.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从墓地
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.16,0:18:27.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤魔人怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.40,0:18:30.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复活吧！弦魔人 姆兹姆兹利兹姆！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.40,0:18:38.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}3只音乐怪兽都齐了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.91,0:18:40.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 游马君 你打算怎么{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.86,0:18:43.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打倒攻击力5000的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.03,0:18:44.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼时空龙呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.18,0:18:45.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.78,0:18:47.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.04,0:18:51.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动魔法卡 魔人管弦乐团！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.98,0:18:54.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在这个回合内
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.91,0:18:57.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}按照魔人怪兽攻击力的合计数值{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.86,0:19:00.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}降低对方怪兽的攻击力！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.40,0:19:00.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.61,0:19:05.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}三只魔人的攻击力合计是4600！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.38,0:19:08.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奏响吧 魔人管弦乐团！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.81,0:19:23.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 银河眼时空龙的攻击力就变成400了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.83,0:19:27.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼时空龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.93,0:19:31.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.69,0:19:32.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.55,0:19:34.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊 魔人们！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.30,0:19:36.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击银河眼！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.47,0:19:39.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}临时音！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.05,0:19:46.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}笨 笨蛋… 银河眼！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.75,0:19:48.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}梅罗林波！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.15,0:19:57.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样就结束了！ 节奏弦！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.31,0:20:04.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好耶～！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.71,0:20:10.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 话说回来 这场决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.00,0:20:11.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底是什么情况？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.09,0:20:13.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谁知道呢… 不过 那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.62,0:20:15.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还真是个相当厉害的决斗者啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.48,0:20:18.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 下次再打一场吧 轨道。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.62,0:20:21.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}笨蛋。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.09,0:20:24.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}早就料到会有这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.17,0:20:26.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以我准备了秘密武器。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.13,0:20:31.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}轨道炮 发射准备OK。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.64,0:20:32.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接招吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.81,0:20:35.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 太菜了！ 没饭吃！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.10,0:20:36.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奥波米小姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.16,0:20:42.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔～！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.57,0:20:59.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎～！？误会？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.11,0:21:02.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我干嘛要对奥波米使坏啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.65,0:21:06.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 又菜又笨又废柴。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.72,0:21:08.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 说得太过分了吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.60,0:21:09.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 很温柔。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.08,0:21:13.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奥比塔尔7是为了奥波米酱
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.39,0:21:14.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才和游马君决斗的…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.54,0:21:19.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咦？ 难道说 奥比塔尔{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.55,0:21:21.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是喜欢奥波米酱吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.68,0:21:23.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什…什么啊？ 突然说这个。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.98,0:21:28.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过呢 这种时候
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.47,0:21:30.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}应该先从朋友做起吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.83,0:21:32.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以… 不是…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.96,0:21:35.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来～吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.13,0:21:38.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}请多指教。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.36,0:21:41.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 遵命链接 俺！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.27,0:21:51.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(海斗)你刚才晃到哪儿去了？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.09,0:21:54.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}海、海…海海海 海斗大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.51,0:21:55.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}急急急 急急忙忙 对不起！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.76,0:21:56.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}报告书 现在这就…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.26,0:21:58.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的决斗 太天真了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.02,0:22:03.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？ 啊… 海斗大人…。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.68,0:22:08.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太可惜了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.87,0:23:42.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.62,0:23:43.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.07,0:23:45.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.52,0:23:47.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.49,0:23:49.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.39,0:23:52.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.46,0:23:54.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
